        {
            "title": "內地8月份一線城市住宅售價按月提升 一二三線按年跌幅續收窄",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國家統計局公布2026年8月份70個大中城市商品住宅售價變動，顯示一線城市住宅售價按月上升；按年比較，則一二三線城市仍下跌，跌幅繼續收窄。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/07/China_Economy_Plenum_704-5.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/07/China_Economy_Plenum_704-5.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">數據顯示，一線城市新建商品住宅售價按月變動，由7月份的持平，轉為8月份上漲0.1%；上海、廣州與深圳分別升0.4%、0.1%及0.2%，北京則跌0.2%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">8月份二線城市新建商品住宅售價按月跌0.1%，降幅與7月份相同；三線城市按月跌0.2%，跌幅較7月份收窄0.1個百分點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">在二手住宅售價方面，一線城市8月份按月升0.1%，漲幅較7月份回落0.1個百分點；上海與深圳按月分別升0.3%及0.1%，廣州持平，北京則跌0.1%。二線與三線城市均按月跌0.3%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">若與2025年同期比較，8月份一線城市新建商品住宅售價跌0.9%，跌幅較7月份收窄0.2個百分點；北京、廣州與深圳分別跌2.3%、1.9%及2.3%，上海升3%。二、三線城市分別跌2.7%及4.1%，跌幅均收窄0.1個百分點。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">二手住宅售價方面，一線城市在8月份按年跌2.7%，跌幅較7月份收窄1個百分點；北京、上海、廣州與深圳分別跌3.5%、0.8%、3.8%及2.7%。二、三線城市則跌4.9%及5.6%，降幅均收窄0.2個百分點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16767695-%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b08%e6%9c%88%e4%bb%bd%e4%b8%80%e7%b7%9a%e5%9f%8e%e5%b8%82%e4%bd%8f%e5%ae%85%e5%94%ae%e5%83%b9%e6%8c%89%e6%9c%88%e6%8f%90%e5%8d%87-%e4%b8%80%e4%ba%8c%e4%b8%89%e7%b7%9a%e6%8c%89%e5%b9%b4",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/01/20230724_FI_source_licensed_china-property_shutterstock-2.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 09:45:52",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
